{
  "title": "The Supplication of Sunday",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْم\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMANIR RAHIM.\nIn the name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الَّذِىْ لَا اَرْجُوْ اِلَّا فَضْلَهٗ\nBISMIL LAAHIL LAZEE LAA ARJOO ILLAA FAZLAHU\nIn the name of Allah, from whom I hope for nothing but bounty,\nوَ لَا اَخْشٰى اِلَّا عَدْلَهٗ\nWA LAA AKHSHAA ILLAA ADLAHU\nand from whom I fear nothing but justice!\nوَ لَا اَعْتَمِدُ اِلَّا قَوْلَهٗ\nWA LAA A-A’TAMEDO ILLAA QAWLAHU \nI rely only upon His word,\nوَ لَا اُمْسِكُ اِلَّا بِحَبْلِهٖ\nWA LAA UMSEKO ILLAA BE-HABLEHI\nand I cling only to His cord!\nبِكَ اَسْتَجِيْرُ يَا ذَالْعَفْوِ وَالرِّضْوَانِ\nBEKA ASTAJEERO YAA ZAL A’FWE WAR RIZWAANE\nIn You I seek sanctuary – O Possessor of pardon and good pleasure –\nمِنَ الظُّلْمِ وَالْعُدْوَانِ\nMENAZ ZULME WAL UDWAANE\nfrom wrong and enmity,\nوَ مِنْ غِيَرِ الزَّمَانِ\nWA MIN GHEYARIZ ZAMAANE\nfrom the changes of time\nوَ تَوَاتُرِ الْاَحْزَانِ\nWA TAWAATORIL AHZAANE\nand the recurrence of sorrows,\nوَ طَوَارِقِ الْحَدَثَانِ\nWA TAWAAREQIL HADASAANE\nfrom the striking of mishaps,\nوَ مِنِ انْقِضَآءِ الْمُدَّةِ\nWA MENIL QAZAAIL MUDDATE\nand from the expiration of my term\nقَبْلَ التَّأَهُّبِ وَالْعُدَّةِ\nQABLAT TA-AH-HOBE WAL U’DDATE\nbefore preparation and readiness.\nوَ اِيَّاكَ اَسْتَرْشِدُ لِمَا فِيْهِ الصَّلاَحُ وَالْاِصْلاَحُ\nWA IYYAAKA ASTARSHEDO LEMAA FEEHIS-SALAAHO WAL ISLAAHO\nFrom You I seek guidance to that wherein is righteousness and being set right.\nوَ بِكَ اَسْتَعِيْنُ فِيْمَا يَقْتَرِنُ بِهِ النَّجَاحُ وَالْاِنْجَاحُ\nWA BEKA ASTA-E’ENO FEEMA YAQTARENO BEHIN NAJAAHO WAL INJAAHO\nFrom You I seek help in that which is linked to success and favourable response.\nوَ اِيَّاكَ اَرْغَبُ فِىْ لِبَاسِ الْعَافِيَةِ وَ تَمَامِهَا\nWA IYYAAKA ARGHABO FEE LEBAASIL A’AFEYATE WA TAMAAMEHA\nYou I beseech for the garment of well-being and its completion\nوَ شُمُوْلِ السَّلَامَةِ وَ دَوَامِهَا\nWA SHOMOOLIS SALAAMATE WA DAWAAMEHAA\nand for the covering of health and its permanence.\nوَ اَعُوْذُبِكَ يَا رَبِّ مِنْ هَمَزَاتِ الشَّيَاطِيْنِ\nWA A’OOZO BEKA YAA RABBE MIN HAMAZAATISH SHAYAATEENE\nI seek refuge in You, my Lord, from the goading of the Satan,\nوَ اَحْتَرِزُ بِسُلْطَانِكَ مِنْ جَوْرِ السَّلَاطِيْنِ\nWA AH-TAREZO BE-SULTAANEKA MIN JAWRIS SALAATEENE\nand I seek protection in Your sovereignty from the injustice of the sovereigns.\nفَتَقَبَّلْ مَا كَانَ مِنْ صَلَاتِىْ وَ صَوْمِىْ\nFA-TAQABBAL MAA KAANA MIN SALAATEE WA SAWMEE\nSo accept my past prayers and fasting\nوَاجْعَلْ غَدِىْ وَمَا بَعْدَهٗ\nWAJ’AL GHADEE WA MAA BA’DAHU\nand make my tomorrow and what is after\nاَفْضَلَ مِنْ سَاعَتِىْ وَ يَوْمِىْ\nAFZALA MIN SAA-A’TEE WA YAWMEE\nbetter than my present hour and my today!\nوَ اَعِزَّنِىْ فِىْ عَشِيْرَتِىْ وَ قَوْمِىْ\nWA A-I’ZZANEE FEE ASHEERATEE WA QAUMEE\nExalt me in my clan and my people\nوَاحْفَظْنِىْ فِىْ يَقَظَتِىْ وَ نَوْمِىْ\nWAH-FAZNEE FEE YAQAZATEE WA NAWMEE\nand protect me in my waking and my sleeping!\nفَاَنْتَ اللهُ خَيْرٌ حَافِظًا\nFA-ANTAL LAAHO KHAIRUN HAAFEZANW\nFor You are Allah, the Best Guardian,\nوَّ اَنْتَ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nWA ANTA ARHAMUR RAAHEMEENA\nand You are the Most Merciful of the merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَبْرَءُ اِلَيْكَ فِىْ يَوْمِىْ هٰذَا\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ABRA-O ELAYKA FEE YAWMEE HAAZAA\nO Allah, I am quit before You on this day of mine\nوَ مَا بَعْدَهٗ مِنَ الْاَحَآدِ مِنَ الشِّرْكِ وَالْاِلْحَادِ\nWA MAA BA’DAHU MENAL AAHAADE MENASH SHIRKE WAL ILHAADE\nand on all Sundays that follow it of associating others with You and of heresy,\nوَ اُخْلِصُ لَكَ دُعَآئِىْ\nWA UKHLESO LAKA DOA’A-EE\nand I devote my supplication sincerely to You,\nتَعَرُّضًا لِلْاِجَابَةِ\nTA-A’RROZAN LIL EJAABATE\naddressing myself to Your response.\nوَ اُقِيْمُ عَلٰى طَاعَتِكَ\nWA OQEEMO A’LAA TA-A’TEKA\nI observe the acts of obedience to You\n رَجَآءً لِلْاِثَابَةِ\nRAJAA-AN LIL-ESAABATE\nfor hope of gaining Your rewards.\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ خَيْرِ خَلْقِكَ\nFA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN KHAYRE KHALQEKAD\nSo bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, the best of Your creation,\nالدَّاعِىْ اِلٰى حَقِّكَ\nDAA-E’E ELAA HAQQEKA\nand the caller to Your truth,\nوَ اَعِزَّنِىْ بِعِزِّكَ الَّذِىْ لَا يُضَامُ\nWA A-A’IZZANEE BE-I’ZZEKAL LAZEE LAA YOZAAMO\nand fortify me with Your almightiness, which is invulnerable,\nوَاحْفَظْنِىْ بِعَيْنِكَ الَّتِىْ لَا تَنَامُ\nWAH FAZNEE BE-A’YNEKAL LATEE LAA TANAAMO\nprotect me with Your eye, which never sleeps,\nوَاخْتِمْ بِالْاِنْقِطَاعِ اِلَيْكَ اَمْرِىْ\nWAKH TIM BIL-INQETAA-E ELAYKA AMREE\nand seal my affair by acting devoutly to You\nوَ بَالْمَغْفِرَةِ عُمْرِىْ\nWA BIL MAGHFERATE U’MREE\nand my life with forgiveness!\nاِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْغَفُوْرُ الرَّحِيْمُ.\nINNAKA ANTAL GHAFOORUR RAHEEM.\nSurely, You are the All-forgiving, the All-compassionate!"
}
